================================================================================
3. PUBLIC DOMAIN / NO COPYRIGHT CLAIM
================================================================================

James Clerk Maxwell, A Treatise on Electricity and Magnetism (1873),
is in the public domain worldwide. This project claims no copyright in:

  - Maxwell's original text
  - Mechanical OCR or typesetting of that text, including Markdown,
    LaTeX, HTML, JSON, or similar reproductions
  - Factual mappings of Maxwell's own article numbers, titles, and
    page numbers, including maxwell_article_index.json when present
  - The input volume README files, which transcribe Maxwell's table
    of contents

You may use those materials without permission or attribution as a
matter of copyright. Citing this project as the digital edition you
used is welcome as scholarly courtesy. It is not a copyright condition.
See CITATION.cff.

